---
import Section from '../../../components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section class="statement" id="profile" labelledBy="approach-title">
  <div class="section-topline"><span class="index">02 / ABOUT</span><span class="label">A little about me</span></div>
  <div class="about-layout">
    <h2 id="approach-title">About me<span>.</span></h2>
    <div class="profile-intro">
      <p>I’m Sreejita, a final-year Immersive Software Engineering student at the University of Limerick. I enjoy turning complex ideas into useful, considered experiences.</p>
      <p>My interests span software engineering, interactive experiences and product thinking. I’m happiest learning something new, solving problems with others and building things people want to use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<Section class="experience" id="experience" labelledBy="experience-title">
  <div class="section-topline"><span class="index">03 / EXPERIENCE</span><span class="label">Internships</span></div>
  <div class="experience-heading">
    <h2 id="experience-title">Experience<span>.</span></h2>
    <p>My work in product and software engineering, from investigating customer issues to building practical tools.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="experience-list">
    <article class="experience-entry">
      <div class="experience-entry__meta"><span>01 / PRODUCT ENGINEERING</span><span>JUN 2026 — AUG 2026</span></div>
      <div class="experience-entry__body">
        <div><h3>Fin from<br />Salesforce<span class="experience-dot">.</span></h3><p class="experience-role">Product Engineering Intern</p></div>
        <div class="experience-copy"><p>Worked on Fin Messenger, investigating customer issues across the web product and mobile, tracing problems through a large production codebase and carefully testing fixes.</p><p>Built a feature that automatically turns off time-sensitive notices after a set period, helping make the product more reliable for the people using it.</p><div class="experience-keywords"><span>Product engineering</span><span>Debugging</span><span>Collaboration</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="experience-entry">
      <div class="experience-entry__meta"><span>02 / SOFTWARE ENGINEERING</span><span>JUN 2025 — DEC 2025</span></div>
      <div class="experience-entry__body">
        <div><h3>Cloudcards<span class="experience-dot">.</span></h3><p class="experience-role">Software Engineering Intern</p></div>
        <div class="experience-copy"><p>Helped build a desktop application for uploading large aviation datasets, making a complex process easier to manage with pause, resume and progress tracking.</p><p>Worked closely with the operations team to understand their workflow and shape a practical tool around the way they work.</p><div class="experience-keywords"><span>Desktop development</span><span>Product thinking</span><span>User workflows</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Section>

<Section class="education" id="education" labelledBy="education-title">
  <div class="section-topline"><span class="index">04 / EDUCATION</span><span class="label">University of Limerick</span></div>
  <div class="education-layout">
    <div><p class="education-kicker">IMMERSIVE SOFTWARE ENGINEERING</p><h2 id="education-title">Education<span>.</span></h2></div>
    <div class="education-detail"><p class="education-degree">Immersive Software Engineering</p><p class="education-meta">Bachelor’s stage · Final year</p><p>My studies span programming, databases, operating systems, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, mobile development and software testing. That breadth has made me comfortable learning new tools and finding my way through unfamiliar problems.</p><div class="education-award"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><small>RECOGNITION</small><p>Transact Campus Scholarship recipient</p></div></div></div>
  </div>
</Section>
